### Client API - try it from IntelliJ (click the green arrow) or VS Code "REST Client" extension.
### Tenant A = 1111..., Tenant B = 2222... (seeded by V2 migration)

@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@tenantA = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@tenantB = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Health check (no tenant header needed)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Create a client in tenant A
POST {{base}}/clients
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ABC Retail Pvt Ltd",
  "primaryContactName": "Asha Verma",
  "primaryContactEmail": "asha@abc-retail.example",
  "notes": "E-commerce rebuild"
}

### List clients in tenant A
GET {{base}}/clients?page=0&size=25
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantA}}

### List clients in tenant B -> should be EMPTY (tenant isolation)
GET {{base}}/clients
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantB}}

### Get one client (paste an id from the create response)
GET {{base}}/clients/PASTE-ID-HERE
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantA}}

### Same id from tenant B -> must be 404
GET {{base}}/clients/PASTE-ID-HERE
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantB}}

### Update only the notes
PATCH {{base}}/clients/PASTE-ID-HERE
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Handover due in March"
}

### Validation error -> 400 with "errors"
POST {{base}}/clients
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "primaryContactEmail": "not-an-email"
}

### Missing tenant header -> 400
GET {{base}}/clients

### Delete (soft) -> 204
DELETE {{base}}/clients/PASTE-ID-HERE
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantA}}
